Togen writes a provenance line into every file it generates. That line is the
credit the project asks for from anyone who ships the generated code.

The studio bundles the providers' own architecture icon sets, each used under
its vendor's terms. The full notice for each is beside the files it covers, at
ui/icons/<vendor>/NOTICE.md, and the studio's About panel shows all three.

  AWS Architecture Icons
    (c) Amazon Web Services. See ui/icons/aws/NOTICE.md.

  Google Cloud architecture icons
    (c) Google LLC. See ui/icons/gcp/NOTICE.md.

  Azure architecture icons
    (c) Microsoft Corporation. See ui/icons/azure/NOTICE.md.
